     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I wanted to mention a couple more things:</div><div><ol><li>This code isn&#39;t perfect; for example I&#39;m not sure if the <span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,136);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">get</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">obj</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> pos </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,102,102);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span> should just be <span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,136);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">get</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">obj</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">. This seems to work, and I got tired of testing different things.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">I don&#39;t normally advocate using .Rdata files, I usually save specific objects using <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">saveRDS</font></span>, but in this case it&#39;s more convenient to save the whole environment.</li></ol><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div></div>"
